  "title": "Extended Service Protection | GARVEE",
  "text": "Get 10% OFF First Buy + Points on Every Order\n\nJoin Free\n\nEnjoy 10% OFF Member Pricing\n\nGet My Discount\n\nMember Pricing：10% OFF + $20\n\nUnlock Savings\n\nGet 10% OFF First Buy + Points on Every Order\n\nJoin Free\nUnited States ( USD$ ) / English\nCustomer Service\nCategories\nNew Arrivals\nBest Sellers🔥\nFlash Deals⚡\nClearance\nDIY Projects & Ideas\nAbout Us\nRewards & Points\nFree Us Shipping\n30 Day No-Hassle Returns\n12-Month Warranty\nWelcome\nSign-in Reward:10% OFF\nNew Arrivals\nBest Sellers🔥\nFlash Deals⚡\nClearance\nDIY Projects & Ideas\nTrending Now\nEverything You Need to Know About Rug Sizes and Placement\nFind the Right One for Your Business Needs\nBuying Guides\nPower Tools Vs. Hand Tools: What You Need to Know\nEverything You Should Know About Wine Cooler\nHow Tos\nDifference Between a Dresser and a Chest of Drawers\nCheap Home Improvement Ideas Boost Your Home's Value\nAbout Us\nRewards & Points\nUnited States ( USD$ ) / English\nSelect Your Country/Region\nUnited Kingdom( GBP£ )\nEnglish\nUnited States( USD$ )\nEnglish\nCanada( CAD$ )\nEnglish\nDeutschland( EUR€ )\nDeutsch\nEspaña( EUR€ )\nEspañol\nFrance( EUR€ )\nFrançais\nItalia( EUR€ )\nItaliano\nHome\nExtended Service Protection\nRegister Now To Extend Your Warranty\nYour Name *\nEmail Address *\nPhone Number *\nOrder Number *\nSubmit\nBy continuing, you agree the GARVEE ESP Privacy Policy (Details)*\nEmail and text me with updates and offers (unsubscribe anytime)\nWhy Choose Extended Service Protection?\nComprehensive Coverage\n\nThis plan covers mechanical and electrical failures, ensuring that your tools and equipment continue to operate at their best.\n\nConvenient Service\n\nEnjoy hassle-free repairs or replacement with no additional costs for covered repairs.\n\nExtended Period\n\nExtend another 6-12 months of additional protection to suit your needs.\n\nQuick Registration\n\nConveniently register with the form below, click & submit.\n\nThe Right Solution\n\nEnjoy hassle-free repairs or replacements with no additional costs.\n\nReal-time Online Support\n\nCustomer support is available by call & email.\n\nGet the Most Out of Your Purchases\n\nGarvee's Extended Service Protection Plan provides comprehensive coverage for your appliances, ensuring they remain in peak condition. Enjoy hassle-free repairs, cost savings on unexpected breakdowns, and extend your product's lifespan with regular maintenance. Sign up for peace of mind and round-the-clock customer support.\n\nCovered Categories\nAutomotive\nFurniture\nAppliances\nPlumbing\nLawn & Garden\nMaterial Handling\nSports & Outdoors\nPower & Hand Tools\nRestaurant & Food Service\nBuilding & Construction\nCleaning & Janitorial Supplies\nToys & Games\nOffice Supplies\nElectrical\nArts & Crafts & Sewing\n\n*Exclusions apply, see full ESP Terms and Conditions for complete details.\n\n*Covers parts and labor for repairs on covered failures at an approved service center. Repair with use of non-original manufactured parts is allowed. If product cannot be repair within 15 days, a new product of equal or similar features, capacity, specifications and/or efficiency and functionality will be provided. Product will also be replaced if the same major failure occurs and requires 3 service call within 12 months. If a replacement product is not available, we will either issue a GARVEE gift card or provide a refund up to the actual cash value of the product, not to exceed the original purchase price of the covered item.\n\n*Replacement of product, issuance of gift card if similar product is not available, or settlement refund, deems plan fully performed.\n\nCan't find the answer you are looking for?\n\nOur Customer Service team is here to help.\n\nCall Us: +1 888 891 2855\nLive chat: Chat with us\nMon - Fri from 9AM to 5PM (PST)\nNeed help? Contact us\nGarvee Info\nAbout Garvee\nSpecial Outlets\nDIY Projects & Ideas\nTerms Of Service\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nCustomer Service\nTrack Your Order\nPayments Policy\nShipping Policy\nWarranty Policy\nRefund & Return Policy\nWorry-Free Purchase\nContact Us\nPartner & Program\nAffiliate Program\nInfluencer Program\nShare and Win\nGarvee Rewards\nProtection Plans\nHelp Center\nWholeSale Program\nSubscribe Now\n\nJoin the Club & Get $10+5% Off\n\nAwards\n© 2026 GARVEE All rights reserved.",
